[32m+[m[32m## Frontend Implementations[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis repository currently contains **two frontend implementations**. This is intentional and reflects the project's current MVP stage.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 1. `frontend/` — Next.js TypeScript application[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe original frontend implementation built with Next.js 14, React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. It provides a fully RTL Arabic-language interface covering all core features: the home dashboard, image interpreter, AI chat, stories archive, and favorites. It also includes a full Jest + React Testing Library test suite.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Use this frontend if you want:** the complete Arabic RTL experience, TypeScript type safety, or to run the frontend test suite.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m# From the frontend/ directory[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm install[m
[32m+[m[32mcp .env.local.example .env.local   # adjust NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL if needed[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm run dev[m
[32m+[m[32m# → http://localhost:3000[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### 2. `al-tariq-frontend/` — Static HTML/CSS/JS application[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA newer static frontend implementation designed specifically for the Al-Tariq experience. It is built with vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — zero build tooling required. It uses a modern English LTR space-themed design with a rich set of pages including exoplanets, weather, pulsar lab, calendar, and mission timeline — pages not yet present in the Next.js frontend.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe static frontend communicates with the same FastAPI backend through `api.js`, which reads the backend URL from `config.js` (default: `http://localhost:8000`). At the current MVP stage, some pages use placeholder/demo data; integration with real backend endpoints is in progress.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**This is the intended direction for the project's future final production interface.**[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Use this frontend if you want:** the latest design direction, the extended page set, or a demonstration without Node.js build tooling.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```bash[m
[32m+[m[32m# From the al-tariq-frontend/ directory[m
[32m+[m[32mnpm start[m
[32m+[m[32m# → http://localhost:3000[m
 ```[m
 [m
[32m+[m[32m> Requires only Node.js 18 or newer (no npm install step — zero dependencies).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Summary comparison[m
