[32m+[m[32m## Backend API Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAll endpoints accept and return JSON. Successful responses use the envelope `{"success": true, "data": {...}}`. Error responses use `{"success": false, "error": {"code": "...", "message": "..."}}`.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Method | Endpoint | Description |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| `GET` | `/health` | Liveness probe — returns `{"status": "ok"}` |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `GET` | `/api/daily-news` | Fetch today's NASA APOD and generate an AI Arabic story |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `GET` | `/api/daily-news/status` | Scheduler status and latest bulletin metadata |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `POST` | `/api/analyze` | Analyse a specific APOD date or free-text space context |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `POST` | `/api/analyze-image` | Upload a space image; returns structured Arabic vision AI analysis |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `POST` | `/api/chat` | Multi-turn Arabic space AI conversation |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `GET` | `/api/space-weather` | Real-time NASA DONKI CME space-weather data (no AI dependency) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| `GET` | `/api/stories` | Paginated APOD story archive (`?count=5&end_date=YYYY-MM-DD`) |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### `POST /api/analyze-image`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAccepts `multipart/form-data`:[m
[32m+[m[32m- `image` — JPEG, PNG, or WEBP file, max 5 MB (required)[m
[32m+[m[32m- `question` — optional Arabic question about the image (max 400 characters)[m
 [m
[31m-> **Security note:** API keys (`NASA_API_KEY`, `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`) must be stored in the backend `.env` file only. Never add them to `frontend/.env.local`. The only frontend variable is `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, which points to the backend server — it contains no secrets.[m
[32m+[m[32mReturns a structured Arabic analysis: title, summary, key observations, scientific explanation, confidence level, and an answer to the user's question (if provided). The image is never stored permanently.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### `POST /api/chat`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAccepts a JSON body with:[m
[32m+[m[32m- `messages` — array of `{role, content}` objects (max 20 turns; user messages truncated at 800 characters)[m
[32m+[m[32m- `image_context` — optional object from a previous `/api/analyze-image` call[m
